{title: Swing Low, Sweet Chariot}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{genre: Gospel}
{flow: Meditative}
{style: Spiritual}
{key: G}
{key_original: F}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Swing low, sweet [C]chariot
[G]Comin' for to carry me [D]home
[G]Swing low, sweet [C]chariot
[G]Comin' for to carry me [D]home[G]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I [G]looked over Jordan and what did I see
Comin' for to carry me [D]home
A [G]band of angels comin' after me
Comin' for to carry me [D]home[G]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
If you [G]get there before I do
Comin' for to carry me [D]home
Tell all my friends I'm comin' too
Comin' for to carry me [D]home[G]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
